[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5281.51, "timestamp": "01:28:01", "text": "哦，然后我想我会按下那个按钮。死亡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5283.43, "timestamp": "01:28:03", "text": "所以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5290.43, "timestamp": "01:28:10", "text": "就定在10左右吧。10左右"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5292.55, "timestamp": "01:28:12", "text": "爱丽丝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5295.75, "timestamp": "01:28:15", "text": "现在是11"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5298.87, "timestamp": "01:28:18", "text": "如果它再次下跌，然后又上涨……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5305.83, "timestamp": "01:28:25", "text": "开始了。我同意。我又做到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5314.39, "timestamp": "01:28:34", "text": "那座还没倒塌呢。哦，他们下车了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5318.03, "timestamp": "01:28:38", "text": "好的。我被分配了一项相当重要的任务。看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5333.629, "timestamp": "01:28:53", "text": "好吧，我想我应该去看一下。即使这样，也超级棒，不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5336.189, "timestamp": "01:28:56", "text": "我什么都看不见。除非用望远镜看，否则根本看不到它。"}]